372→                heading="No delivery rules yet"
373→                image="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0262/4071/2726/files/emptystate-files.png"
374→                action={{
375→                  content: "Create your first rule",
376→                  onAction: openCreate,
377→                }}
378→              >
379→                <p>
380→                  Delivery rules let you set fees, minimum order amounts,
381→                  estimated delivery times, and delivery schedules for different
382→                  zones. Rules are evaluated by priority order.
